<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <style>
        .container { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .code { font-size: 32px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 5px; padding: 15px; background: #f0f0f0; display: inline-block; margin: 20px 0; }
        .instructions { margin: 20px 0; line-height: 1.6; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h2>Hello {{name}},</h2>
        <p>We received a request to reset your {{appName}} password.</p>
        
        <p>Your password reset code is:</p>
        <div class="code">{{resetCode}}</div>
        
        <div class="instructions">
            <p>Enter this code in the password reset screen.</p>
            <p>This code will expire on: {{expirationTime}}</p>
            <p>If you didn't request a password reset, please ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
        
        <p>Best regards,<br>The {{appName}} Team</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>